  "notes": "Original first pressing. Green label w/ W7 logo.\n\nMedley 'That's It For The Other One'; Part A1-IV (We Leave The Castle) is listed on label but completely missing from back liner track song titles.\nThere are no track timings.\n\nIce-Nine Pub. BMI\n\nStudios:\nSept. '67 - RCA Studio A, Hollywood\nOct. 67 - American Studios, No. Hollywood\nDec. '67 - Century Sound, New York / Olmstead Studios, New York\nLive:\n11/10-11/67 Shrine Exposition, L.A.\nStereo Mix Mastering:\nColumbus Recorders, San Francisco\nCriteria Studio, Miami\nApostolic Studios, New York\n\nThis issue has Roman numerals for indexing track A1 and center label side indication.\nThere's also a [r5722577] similar US issue, where standard numbers are used on center label.",
  "released_formatted": "Aug 1968",
